      "id": "3d38d40651bcf22f77c85ff817371d49aab580ac514284ebcb7ea81a0fc68266",
      "title": "As Democrats swept the midterms, news anchors struggled to find the words",
      "url": "https://awfulannouncing.com/espn/joe-scarborough-pat-mcafee-college-gameday.html",
      "category": "uncategorized",
